@node no1 " Introduction"

                    XIM Module for AmiExpress 2.xx - 3.xx

                  This is a fast and ang fukk`n good looking 
                 Frontend Door for /X with some good Features
            It supports the Quiet Mode if you have your Node QUIET 
                     so you not shown in the Frontend...
                             * Example Output: *

                 Nd#        Node-Status         Node-Action
             ··==================================================··
                 Nd0   Node is busy...       Uploading Warez 
                 Nd1   Node is busy...       Downloading Warez
                 Nd2   Your Node...          Logging on...      
                 Nd3   Node is free for the  next Caller !!! 
             ··==================================================··
              dre!front v1.o by dr.dre!/trsi xim module for /X 3.x

@endnode
@node no2 " Requirements"

                You need an Amiga 500/1000/1200/2000/3000/4000
                          Kickstart 2.0 or higher
                     Ami Express 2.xx - 3.xx (Registered)

@endnode
@node no3 " Installation"

                    If you have /X 2.xx - 3.20 so copy the
                       drefront9.XiM File to your Doors
                     and the Frontend.Info to your Syscmd
                   if you have /X 3.30++ running so take the
              drefront32.XiM Version this is the 32 Node Version !

                 NOTE: The Frontend.Info is configured for the
                 32 Node Version if you use the 9 Node Version 
                       then you have to change the Icon...

have Phun...
@endnode
